            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[K]</span> (Coming back to your experience since<span class="Itxt"> </span>~~yyyymmminus3~~, how about on grounds of) Your political opinion, such as expressing political views, defending the rights of others, being a member or not of a political party or trade union?</p><div><br/></div><p></p>
